# Project Context: what the AI sees about your codebase
Output project-context.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Type "cd sample-project && nvim init.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type ":DwightProjectContext"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms

Sleep 3s
